##################################
# Building the Android Toolchain #
##################################

You need to have installed Android SDK and NDK before compiling PariDroid
from source.

Run the configure and make_android_toolchain scripts:
   cd scripts
   ./configure PATH_TO_ANDROID_NDK PATH_TO_ANDROID_SDK
   ./make_android_toolchain
   cd ..

Now build everything:
   make


###########################
